        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many traditional Chinese "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "performing arts",
            "ref": "v-performing-arts"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are hundreds of years old. They are unique in their sights and sounds. Over the past few "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "decades",
            "ref": "v-decade"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", more and more Chinese artists have been working to bring Chinese art "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You can see such "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in a new documentary series, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "China on Stage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The series is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "joint production",
            "zh": "联合制片"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between China and the U.K. You can watch it on the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "BBC’s",
            "zh": "英国广播公司"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " website and on Bilibili. The Chinese video site Bilibili is one of the series’ "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The series "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the interviews of more than twenty Chinese artists. These artists have been working on "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " different Chinese art forms with fresh "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "global influences",
            "ref": "v-global-influence"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The art forms include "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " arts such as Peking Opera and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "shadow play",
            "zh": "皮影戏"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". You can also see "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "imported",
            "ref": "v-imported"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " art forms such as ballet and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "opera",
            "zh": "歌剧"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " do you know about these performing arts? Find out more by "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the series! It would be great if you could "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Chinese art forms to your foreign friends. Let’s help "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Chinese culture around the world!"
          }
        ]
      }
